---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About ATECT Architecture | Maryland Architecture Firm"
  description="Learn about ATECT Architecture, founded in 2004, and its residential and commercial design approach serving Maryland, Washington, DC, and Virginia."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">About ATECT</div>
    <h1>The Design Solution.</h1>
    <p>
      ATECT Architecture is a residential and commercial design firm serving Maryland,
      Washington, DC and Virginia, with a focus on balancing comfort, practicality and beauty.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="split-about">
    <div>
      <div
        class="about-image"
        style="background-image:url('https://static.wixstatic.com/media/9aae58f8cb39c0432380467cfa4e74eb.jpg/v1/fill/w_2400,h_1500,al_c,q_95,enc_auto/9aae58f8cb39c0432380467cfa4e74eb.jpg')"
        role="img"
        aria-label="Blueprint Design by ATECT Architecture"
      ></div>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <div class="eyebrow">Charlie Jones · Project Architect</div>
      <h2>Experience grounded in practical design.</h2>
      <p>
        Charlie Jones has worked as a Project Architect and Manager at ATECT Architecture since
        2004, balancing practical functionality with design quality throughout the project process.
      </p>
      <p>
        ATECT Architecture was founded in 2004. The firm's stated approach is to create inspiring
        projects that balance comfort, practicality and beauty while improving the quality of life
        for the people who use the spaces.
      </p>
      <p>
        ATECT's work is primarily based in Maryland and the DC area, with a willingness to travel
        for exceptional projects.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Who we serve</div>
        <h2>Design support for different project needs.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-intro">
        ATECT's original service structure addresses homeowners, builders and design professionals.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <article>
        <h3>Homeowners</h3>
        <p>
          Residential design for additions, kitchen renovations, bathroom renovations, decks,
          porches and new homes, through the construction-document phase with project coordination
          and management.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Builders</h3>
        <p>
          Construction documents from design through the construction-document phase for
          residential, commercial, interior fit-outs and as-built projects.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <h3>Design Professionals</h3>
        <p>
          Subcontracting support including field measuring, design support and construction-document
          assistance.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section philosophy-section">
    <div class="philosophy-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Philosophy</div>
        <h2>Our priority is always our customers and their unique needs.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="philosophy-copy">
        <p>
          We pride ourselves on being responsive to clients in a thorough and timely manner while
          maintaining a superior quality of work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section capabilities-section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Capabilities</div>
        <h2>Professional design services.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="section-intro">
        ATECT Architecture provides design and drafting capabilities across architecture and interior design.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="capability-grid">
      <article><strong>541310</strong><span>Architecture</span></article>
      <article><strong>541340</strong><span>Drafting</span></article>
      <article><strong>541410</strong><span>Interior Design</span></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="prose">
    <h2>A practical design process.</h2>
    <p>
      Clear communication is central to the work. Early decisions establish direction; design
      development refines the solution; documentation communicates the final intent. Clients
      should understand what is being designed and why before moving into construction.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">
      <strong>Service Area</strong><br />
      Maryland • Washington, DC • Virginia
    </div>

    <a class="button dark" href="/contact">Discuss Your Project</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style is="global">
  .split-about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 90px 24px;
  }

  .about-image {
    min-height: 520px;
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .about-grid article {
    padding: 28px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
  }

  .about-grid h3 {
    font: 600 25px Manrope;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  .about-grid p {
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .philosophy-section {
    background: #fff;
  }

  .philosophy-grid {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .philosophy-grid h2 {
    font: 600 clamp(32px, 4vw, 52px)/1.08 Manrope;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .philosophy-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #555;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .capabilities-section {
    background: #f5f5f2;
  }

  .capability-grid {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .capability-grid article {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ddd;
    padding: 30px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .capability-grid strong {
    font: 600 14px Manrope;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    color: #777;
  }

  .capability-grid span {
    font: 600 25px Manrope;
  }

  .callout {
    margin: 35px 0;
    padding: 25px;
    border-left: 3px solid #111;
    background: #f5f5f2;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .split-about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    .about-image {
      min-height: 360px;
    }

    .about-grid,
    .philosophy-grid,
    .capability-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .philosophy-grid {
      gap: 30px;
    }
  }
</style>
